GIVEN `the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company passes a special resolution for reducing its share capital` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company meets the requirements under section 78C(1)(c) and the solvency requirements (if applicable) under section 78C(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `one or more applications for cancellation of the resolution have been made under section 78D(2) during the 6 weeks beginning with the resolution date` IS A BOOLEAN
